        "b0": "WIFIGATE is not directed to children under 16, and we do not knowingly collect personal data from them through accounts. An administrator who enrols a minor on a controller, for example a family member, is responsible for obtaining any consent required by law. If you believe a child has given us personal data, contact us and we will delete it."
